 "source": "Boundaries of Europe in July 1914: Jack Kavanagh, \"Map of Europe, c. 1914\", University College Dublin, Zenodo, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20119653 (CC BY 4.0). Clipped to the European theatre and simplified. The coast of the island of Ireland is completed from Natural Earth 1:50m (public domain), because the source draws chords across its eastern bays.",
